        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nI want to emphasize how exceptional my very first appointment with Martine was. From the very first minutes, she put me at ease with her gentleness, kindness, and incredibly human approach.\n\nHer work is impeccable and carried out with genuine care. I truly felt that her approach was personalized, that she took the time to listen to me and understand my needs. For a first meeting, I couldn't have dreamed of anything better: Martine is professional, efficient, and incredibly caring.\n\nI recommend her 1000%, without any hesitation. Thanks to her, you immediately feel in good hands… and you leave already with a smile. 🩵\n\nSadaf J",
